  "title": "Joni&#39;s Leftover Turkey Salad",
  "description": "This leftover turkey salad features sweet relish, Dijon mustard, almonds, cranberries, and seasoning that makes a perfect, quick and easy option for lunchtime sandwiches or salads.",
